.88-23.20 (TRA cut at the last station inside the box; THSR shown Chiayi - Tainan; Zuoying is on the Kaohsiung map). Geometry and station positions © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL (TRA and THSR routed on the OSM track network; simplified ~15 m). The Tainan railway undergrounding (8.23 km) opened in October 2026; its two new commuter stations Linsen (2029) and South Tainan (2030) are under construction. Blue Line phase 1 (8.39 km straddle monorail, B1-B10): comprehensive plan approved by the Executive Yuan 2025-10-21, design-build tender closed 2026-09-29 with no award reported, target 2033. Its Rende - Guiren - THSR Tainan / Guanmiao extension (15 km, planned) and the Green Line (proposed) are not drawn because no station sites are published. Future station names are working names and positions approximate (some about 1 km). TRA and THSR have no line colours (colours chosen for the map); the Blue Line has no published hex."}